C_EXPORT ..> (List Tasks) : retrieves all
C_EXPORT ..> (List Comments) : retrieves per-task
C_IMPORT ..> (Validate JSON) : validates structure
C_IMPORT ..> (Detect Duplicates) : avoids overwrites
C_IMPORT ..> (Restore Tasks) : recreates objects
C_IMPORT ..> (Restore Comments) : recreates objects

G_VIEW_ALL ..> (Refresh Display) : updates list
G_FILTER ..> (Refresh Display) : updates list
G_FILTER ..> (Filter by Status) : applies filter
G_OVERDUE ..> (Refresh Display) : updates list
G_OVERDUE ..> (Highlight Red) : visual indicator
G_ADD ..> (Show Dialog) : input form
G_START ..> (Update Task) : changes status
G_COMPLETE ..> (Update Task) : changes status
G_REOPEN ..> (Update Task) : changes status
G_DELETE ..> (Confirm Action) : user confirmation
G_DELETE ..> (Update Task) : deletes task

